1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,120
How did Mrs. Sterling get her bag back?
斯特林夫人是怎样拿回提包的？

2
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:16,630
How did Mrs. Sterling get her bag back?
斯特林夫人是怎样拿回提包的？

3
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:23,230
Mrs. Anne Sterling did not think of the risk
安妮·斯特林夫人没有考虑到风险，

4
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:28,050
she was taking when she ran through a forest after two men.
她穿过森林追赶两个男人时所冒的风险。

5
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:35,380
They had rushed up to her while she was having a picnic at the edge of a forest
她正带着孩子们在森林边上野餐时，那两个人突然冲到她面前，

6
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:38,940
with her children and tried to steal her handbag.
企图抢走她的手提包。

7
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:44,450
In the struggle, the strap broke and,
在争抢中，包带断了，

8
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:46,490
with the bag in their possession,
包到了他们手里，

9
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:49,710
both men started running through the trees.
两个男人开始穿过树林跑起来。

10
00:00:51,070 --> 00:00:55,280
Mrs. Sterling got so angry that she ran after them.
斯特林夫人非常气愤，就追了上去。

11
00:00:55,680 --> 00:01:00,110
She was soon out of breath, but she continued to run.
她很快就上气不接下气，但仍继续追赶。

12
00:01:01,770 --> 00:01:03,560
When she caught up with them,
当她追上他们时，

13
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:08,960
she saw that they had sat down and were going through the contents of the bag,
她看见他们正坐在地上翻包里的东西，

14
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:11,460
so she ran straight at them.
于是她直冲过去。

15
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:16,670
The men got such a fright that they dropped the bag and ran away.
那两个人吓得扔下包就跑。

16
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:22,050
'The strap needs mending,' said Mrs. Sterling later,
“这包带需要修一修，”斯特林夫人后来说，

17
00:01:22,930 --> 00:01:24,740
'but they did not steal anything.'
“不过他们什么也没偷走。”
